# Optional. Without these, flaky-finder runs in rules-only mode and reports
# UNVERIFIED for anything the deterministic rules don't recognize — it never
# guesses. Any OpenAI-chat-compatible endpoint serving an open-weight model works.

# Groq (free tier, serves open-weight models — GPT-OSS, Llama, Qwen, ...):
FLAKY_FINDER_API_KEY=
FLAKY_FINDER_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
FLAKY_FINDER_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b

# Run `curl https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/models -H "Authorization: Bearer $FLAKY_FINDER_API_KEY"`
# to see which models your account currently has access to — Groq's lineup
# changes, and a model id that worked last month can 404 today.

# Or: a model already running locally via Ollama (true local inference, no
# cloud dependency at all). Ollama's OpenAI-compat endpoint ignores the API
# key's value, but our code still requires the var to be non-empty:
# FLAKY_FINDER_API_KEY=ollama
# FLAKY_FINDER_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1
# (use 127.0.0.1, not localhost — Node can resolve "localhost" to the IPv6
# ::1 address, which fails to connect if Ollama only listens on IPv4)
# FLAKY_FINDER_MODEL=llama3.2:3b   # <- run `ollama list` and use your exact tag
#
# Prefer a plain instruct model (Llama 3.2, Llama 3.1, ...) over a "thinking"/
# reasoning model (Qwen3 and similar) for this specific endpoint combination.
# Verified: a reasoning model's internal <think> phase conflicted with forced
# JSON output (response_format: json_object) through Ollama badly enough to
# never return within a 2-minute window, uncapped by max_tokens — a known
# rough edge in grammar-constrained decoding + reasoning models, not
# something fixable from the client side. A plain instruct model doesn't hit
# this at all and returns in a few seconds.
#
# FLAKY_FINDER_TIMEOUT_MS (default 120000 = 2 min) controls how long we wait
# before giving up — mainly useful for slow hardware, not reasoning models.
# FLAKY_FINDER_TIMEOUT_MS=180000
#
# Caps total generated tokens so a response can't run unbounded. 800 is
# plenty for one sentence of explanation.
# FLAKY_FINDER_MAX_TOKENS=800